<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Dear Permit Holder,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">As part of the new German Village parking plan, the current A permit zone will be removed and replaced with the new GV permit zone.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Your current permit(s) will be deactivated this week and you will be required to reapply for business permits for your current address. Please note, we have stopped enforcement of all “A” permits, however, we are still enforcing safety violations.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Your business is eligible for up to 10 permits and will be valid January 1<sup>st</sup> to December 31<sup>st</sup> of each year. Because you are applying late in the year, your new permit(s) will be extended to expire December 31<sup>st</sup>, 2026. Enforcement of your new “GV” permit will begin November 1<sup>st</sup>. Please see the attached information for the cost breakdown for business permits.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Starting September 17, you may apply for permits by visiting the permit portal at <a href="https://columbus.permitinfo.net/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" title="https://columbus.permitinfo.net/" data-outlook-id="50eca4c1-6fbe-4bce-85ab-8030234fa43d" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://columbus.permitinfo.net/</a>.  </strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong><em>Enforcement of GV permits in this area will begin November 3.</em></strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you have any further questions or concerns, please email <a href="mailto:parkingservices@columbus.gov" title="mailto:parkingservices@columbus.gov" data-outlook-id="f594a930-ed1e-4c90-b5a0-c9759e44d4ae" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">parkingservices@columbus.gov</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you,<br>Columbus Division of Mobility and Parking Services</p>
